  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "歇寒看電影"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">作者：張芳莉</span><br /><br /><br /><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Tsit擺ê歇寒lóng無走去佗位tshit-thô，一--來是因為新冠肺炎使人bē放心；二--來是因為阮hit隻寶貝狗Cello阿弟仔已經有年歲--ah，無適合koh放伊一个leh顧厝。就是因為tsit種ê機緣，hōo我有時間ē-tàng看幾齣以早早就想beh看，suah lóng無時間thang看ê好電影！</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">一齣號做《四海兄弟》（Once upon a time in America）。伊是leh講五个自細漢褲頭kat做伙ê好兄弟，大漢了後因為理念ê無sio-siâng，最後pìnn面冤家，死--ê死，逃--ê逃。用計陷害，kā對方ê tshit仔、錢lóng kuānn-kuānn--去，經過30幾冬，人lóng老--ah，tsiah想beh彌補以早ê過錯，代誌tsiah piak空--出-來。Tsit个劇情tsiânn精采，m̄-koh對無耐性ê人來講，絕對坐bē tiâu！因為伊ê片長竟然超過四點鐘！若無liōng-siōng ê時間，根本to無法度看煞。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">另外三齣mā tsiok好看，是《教父》第一集到第三集。Tse是leh講意大利烏社會ê故事，片長mā lóng超過三點鐘。我看煞了後有真深ê感覺，序大人tiānn-tiānn kā lán教示講歹路m̄-thang行，m̄-thang去bak烏社會、去做tshit-thô囡仔，若無，你就ē拖屎連。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">我koh有tsiânn深ê感慨，lán人ê運命kám是已經注定好--ah？有tang時hōo環境逼--著，ē hōo家己身不由己，做一寡姑不而將ê代誌，想beh回頭mā無法度！Tsiânn實有夠無奈。逐家lóng想beh好額、有錢、有名聲，m̄-koh過程ài有tsiânn大ê付出kap犧牲。等家己peh tsiūnn上kuân ê地位，suah感覺tsiânn孤單。逐家lóng驚--我，隨時giâu疑有人beh kā我khiú--落-來……。Hainnh，人生實在是tsiânn歹liú-lia̍h。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">一目nih，歇寒已經beh結束--ah！Tsit擺ê歇睏，因為tsit幾齣電影，m̄-nā充實我ê智識，mā hōo我tsit个平凡ê女子做一場烏道大姊頭仔ê江湖夢。另外，tsit擺新冠肺炎hōo逐家kap厝--裡ê人ke bē少時間thang鬥陣，往好ê方向來看，是聯絡感情ê好機會。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">閒話減講，行！逐家sio招坐客廳，做伙來看電影！&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br /></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>#逐家來phò-tāu&nbsp;專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報324期，2021年3月出刊。</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg15gjibmTXy4sSPf6SrWMQHmUCH9xNvWH_NU1Wp9NzumavCiq